  • Stage 4: audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, satisfiable states, and concrete substitutions
  • Stage 5: inventory and statically validate every syntax/function/rule/attribute
  • Stage 6: build and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  • Stage 7: account for proven facts versus assumptions and write/verify REVIEW.md
